{"id":"19c8b0267ad22ce9","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy.md","title":"Kleene O and Effective Transfinite Jumps","display":"df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy — Kleene O and Effective Transfinite Jumps","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy","aliases":["92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy"],"display":"df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy — Kleene O and Effective Transfinite Jumps","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-turing-jump]]","[[92-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy — Kleene O and Effective Transfinite Jumps"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51f43fedeac3bf1d\" href=\"?note=51f43fedeac3bf1d\" title=\"92-df-turing-jump\">92-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed acceptable enumeration of unary partial-recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (fixed injective pairing map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\mapsto A&#39;\">\\(A\\mapsto A&#39;\\)</span> (Turing jump formed with a fixed acceptable oracle numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"51f43fedeac3bf1d\" href=\"?note=51f43fedeac3bf1d\" title=\"92-df-turing-jump\">92-df-turing-jump</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\coloneqq J(0,0)\">\\(z\\coloneqq J(0,0)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(a)\\coloneqq J(1,a)\">\\(s(a)\\coloneqq J(1,a)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e)\\coloneqq J(2,e)\">\\(\\ell(e)\\coloneqq J(2,e)\\)</span> (disjoint tagged constructors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr O,\\mathcal O_K,|\\cdot|_K,(H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_K}\">\\(\\mathscr O,\\mathcal O_K,|\\cdot|_K,(H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_K}\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>Let <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathscr O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> be the least relation generated by the following rules:</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{(z,0)\\in\\mathscr O},\\qquad\n\\frac{(a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O}{(s(a),\\alpha+1)\\in\\mathscr O},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{(z,0)\\in\\mathscr O},\\qquad\n\\frac{(a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O}{(s(a),\\alpha+1)\\in\\mathscr O},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\\quad\n(\\alpha_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^{\\mathbb N}\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[(\\varphi_e(n),\\alpha_n)\\in\\mathscr O\\land\\alpha_n&lt;\\alpha_{n+1}\\bigr]\n}{\n(\\ell(e),\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\alpha_n)\\in\\mathscr O\n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\\quad\n(\\alpha_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^{\\mathbb N}\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[(\\varphi_e(n),\\alpha_n)\\in\\mathscr O\\land\\alpha_n&lt;\\alpha_{n+1}\\bigr]\n}{\n(\\ell(e),\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\alpha_n)\\in\\mathscr O\n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Then</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}o\\text{-}jump\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;((a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O)\\},\\\\\n|a|_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O,\\\\\nH_z&amp;\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\nH_{s(a)}&amp;\\coloneqq(H_a)&#39;\\qquad(a\\in\\mathcal O_K),\\\\\nH_{\\ell(e)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{J(n,x)\\mid n,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land x\\in H_{\\varphi_e(n)}\\}\n\\qquad(\\ell(e)\\in\\mathcal O_K).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}o\\text{-}jump\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;((a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O)\\},\\\\\n|a|_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O,\\\\\nH_z&amp;\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\nH_{s(a)}&amp;\\coloneqq(H_a)&#39;\\qquad(a\\in\\mathcal O_K),\\\\\nH_{\\ell(e)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{J(n,x)\\mid n,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land x\\in H_{\\varphi_e(n)}\\}\n\\qquad(\\ell(e)\\in\\mathcal O_K).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>：由零、后继和有效严格递增极限规则生成的递归序数记号系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|a|_K\">\\(|a|_K\\)</span>：记号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>所表示的序数；带标签的生成规则保证每个记号的值唯一，但同一递归序数可以有多个记号</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_a\">\\(H_a\\)</span>：沿记号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>构造的有效超限Turing跳跃；后继层取跳跃，极限层用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>作各早期层的有效直和</li>\n<li>“最小关系”排除了没有有限或超限生成依据的伪记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>本身一般不是可判定集</li>\n<li>不同可接受编号或等价的标准记号系统可以改变具体编码，但不改变由“可归约到某个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_a\">\\(H_a\\)</span>”得到的超算术集合类</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"51f43fedeac3bf1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed acceptable enumeration of unary partial-recursive functions, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (fixed injective pairing map, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"51f43fedeac3bf1d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\mapsto A'$ (Turing jump formed with a fixed acceptable oracle numbering, see [[92-df-turing-jump]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ (class of ordinals, see [[92-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\mapsto A'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\coloneqq J(0,0)","display":false},{"tex":"s(a)\\coloneqq J(1,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e)\\coloneqq J(2,e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr O,\\mathcal O_K,|\\cdot|_K,(H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{}{(z,0)\\in\\mathscr O},\\qquad\n\\frac{(a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O}{(s(a),\\alpha+1)\\in\\mathscr O},","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\\quad\n(\\alpha_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^{\\mathbb N}\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[(\\varphi_e(n),\\alpha_n)\\in\\mathscr O\\land\\alpha_n<\\alpha_{n+1}\\bigr]\n}{\n(\\ell(e),\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\alpha_n)\\in\\mathscr O\n}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}o\\text{-}jump\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal O_K&\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;((a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O)\\},\\\\\n|a|_K&\\coloneqq\\alpha\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(a,\\alpha)\\in\\mathscr O,\\\\\nH_z&\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\nH_{s(a)}&\\coloneqq(H_a)'\\qquad(a\\in\\mathcal O_K),\\\\\nH_{\\ell(e)}&\\coloneqq\\{J(n,x)\\mid n,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land x\\in H_{\\varphi_e(n)}\\}\n\\qquad(\\ell(e)\\in\\mathcal O_K).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_K","display":false},{"tex":"|a|_K","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"H_a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_K","display":false},{"tex":"H_a","display":false}],"bytes":2701,"backlinks":[{"id":"f13740fe3d0acf2e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_K$ (recursive-ordinal notation system, see [[92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b","20fe67463d98fb92","51f43fedeac3bf1d","afb378126cbf5f83"]}